    "description": "Available now \u2013 FURNISHED or UNFURNISHED.\nWELCOME to this beautifully remodeled single-family residence in San Francisco's sought-after Outer Richmond neighborhood. Offering approximately 2,245 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space, this inviting home blends timeless character with modern comforts, creating the perfect setting for both everyday living and effortless entertaining.\nFilled with natural light and enhanced by soaring ceilings, hardwood floors, and tasteful finishes throughout, the home offers a rare combination of warmth, elegance, and versatility. Whether you're gathering with family, hosting friends, working from home, or simply enjoying a quiet evening, you'll find spaces that comfortably adapt to your lifestyle.\nPerfectly situated just moments from Balboa Street's beloved caf\u00e9s, bakeries, neighborhood restaurants, markets, and local shops, this home also enjoys easy access to the vibrant Clement Street corridor. Golden Gate Park, Ocean Beach, Lands End, and the Presidio are all within easy reach, while nearby Muni 38 Geary bus line is just around the corner from the house, providing convenient public transport to Downtown San Francisco and Financial District. Easy access to Marin County, Silicon Valley and beyond.\n*HOME FEATURES\nUPPER LEVEL\n\u2022 Sun-filled living room with decorative fireplace and large picture windows\n\u2022 Formal dining room ideal for family meals and entertaining\n\u2022 Gourmet kitchen with premium appliances, granite countertops, and abundant storage\n\u2022 Two spacious bedroom suites\n\u2022 Flexible den connected to the primary suite, perfect for a home office, nursery, guest room, or additional bedroom\n\u2022 Primary suite with direct access to the backyard\n\u2022 Upgraded bathroom featuring a bidet\n\u2022 Hardwood flooring throughout living areas and bedrooms\n\u2022 Marble flooring in the kitchen and bathrooms\nLOWER LEVEL\n\u2022 Two generously sized bedrooms and two full bathrooms\n\u2022 Spacious lounge or media room\n\u2022 Additional full bathroom\n\u2022 Direct backyard access from multiple rooms\n\u2022 Bidet-equipped bathrooms\nOUTDOOR & PARKING\n\u2022 Beautifully landscaped private backyard for entertaining, relaxation, and outdoor gathering\n\u2022 One-car garage with additional storage\n\u2022 Additional driveway parking space\n*RENTAL TERMS\n\u2022 First month's rent plus security deposit equal to one month's rent\n\u2022 Tenant responsible for utilities and routine maintenance of the front and rear yards\n\u2022 No smoking\n\u2022 No roommates or house-sharing arrangements\n\u2022 No pets\n\u2022 Service and support animals, as defined by law, are welcome\n\u202218-month lease preferred; otherwise, minimum 12-month lease\nFor additional information or to schedule a private showing, please contact:\nMaria Chavez\nREALTOR\u00ae\nDRE #01937116\neXp Realty\nEqual Housing Opportunity\nInformation contained herein is deemed reliable but not guaranteed and is subject to change without notice. Prospective tenants are encouraged to independently verify all information and conduct their own inspection of the property prior to renting. We are an Equal Opportunity Housing provider and comply with all federal, state, and local fair housing laws.",
