    "description": "83 Albion Street #3, San Francisco, CA 94103 - Cross Street: 16th Street\n**EMAIL FOR VIRTUAL TOUR**\nTop Floor Four Bedroom in Heart of Mission | In Unit Washer/Dryer | Tenants Pay All Utilities | One Year Lease\nDESCRIPTION:\nThis recently renovated top floor four-bedroom apartment is the ideal set up for roommates. Completely repainted, refurbished appliances including dishwasher in kitchen and brand-new laminate flooring throughout. Tons of light throughout. One Bedroom in the front of the unit with views of Twin Peaks, with the remaining three set off to the back, all four with large closets. Living room, dining room and kitchen all connected and open, great for entertaining. Two full bathrooms, shower over tub in back bathroom.\nCentrally located on Albion and 16th Street a block away from Valencia Street, home to San Francisco's best cafes, bars, and restaurants as well as a commuters dream near 16th and Mission Bart Station, 280 S and Muni lines on Market Street and Church Street. Whole Foods Supermarket is 2 blocks away.\nFEATURES:\n-\tFour Bedrooms/2 Bathrooms\n-\tUpdated kitchen appliances\n-\tUpgraded flooring throughout\n-\tJust repainted\n-\tIn Unit Washer/Dryer\nNEIGHBORHOOD:\n- 100 Walk Score: Daily Errands Don't Require a Car\n- 84 Transit Score: Close to major Transit including Muni and 16th Street BART Station\n- 100 Bike Score: Excellent Bike Lanes!\n- Easy access to freeways I-280, HWY101\n- 5 Minute Walk to Tech Shuttle Stops at Valencia and 16th Street\n- Short Walk to Dolores Park and Valencia Street Shops and Restaurants\nSHOWINGS:\nPrivate Showings Available by Appointment\nLEASING TERMS:\n-Available NOW\n-Rent: $8,250.00 per Month\n-Security Deposit: One Year Lease\n- Tenants Pay All Utilities\n*Pets to be considered on case-by-case basis\n*NO Smokers\nVirtual-Staging Disclosure: Certain photographs have been virtually staged to illustrate the potential use and appearance of the rooms. Furniture, artwork, and decorative items shown in the virtually staged photographs are not included with the rental.\nPLEASE CONTACT:\nBrendan Landeck |\nshow contact info\n| Laurel Realty | DRE# 01905168",
